sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Visitor
  participant SPA as React SPA
  participant API as Django API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Visitor->>SPA: Open Terms and Privacy routes
  SPA-->>Visitor: Render legal text and links

  Visitor->>SPA: Submit registration
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register/
  Note over SPA,API: No accepted_terms, accepted_privacy or document-version payload is required.
  API->>DB: Create user and related records
  Note over API,DB: No LegalAcceptance or ConsentRecord model/table is written.
  API-->>SPA: Registration response

  Visitor->>SPA: Existing user calls protected API
  SPA->>API: Request with JWT/API key
  Note over API: No legal-version/hash middleware or permission gate.
  API-->>SPA: Normal endpoint auth/permission result; no legal-specific 403.

  Visitor->>SPA: Create API key
  SPA->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/api-keys/
  API->>DB: Create key record
  API-->>SPA: Raw key once

  Note over SPA,DB: No acceptance hash comparison, legal 403, re-acceptance or rollback flow exists in audited code.
  Note over SPA,DB: Age/date-of-birth validation was not found.
